    {"type":"custom","format":"\u001b[38;5;88m\n\n\n\nThere was once a tiger-striped cat.\nThis cat died a million deaths, and lived a million lives,\nand in those lives, various people owned him.\nNone of those people he cared for.\nThis cat was not afraid of death.\nOne life, the cat became a stray cat, which meant it was free.\nAnd it met a \u001b[38;5;15mwhite female cat\u001b[38;5;88m.\nThey became mates, and lived together.\nTime passed, the \u001b[38;5;15mwhite cat\u001b[38;5;88m passed away of old age.\nAnd the tiger-striped cat cried a million times.\nEventually, the cat died again.\nBut this time, it didn't come back to life.🥀\n\u001b[38;5;196m\u001b[0m"},
